      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:32:29 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249842095058125e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525005691812327424",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers A customer called the police. The store personnel didn't even files a complaint.  @ronfullwood",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:28:05 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.25005282305663e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525007396457160706",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers @washingtonpost Outstanding discussion, @SuzyBlueLady. Thanks so much for your committment and support!",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:34:52 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499963368546714e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524995485715935232",
      "text": "@ronfullwood @washingtonpost Wouldn't it be awkward far a tall guy like that to throw punches through the window? #MikeBrown",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:47:32 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249863012890788e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524991269756747776",
      "text": "@washingtonpost Why isn't this 'evidence' being weighed in this report against other witnesses' accounts which contradict Wilson's?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:30:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249842095058125e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525005338719059969",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers Surely you have an opinion about whether the shooting was justified. #Ferguson @ronfullwood @washingtonpost",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:26:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2500481080295424e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525005004894400512",
      "text": "@SuzyBlueLady @ronfullwood I can appreciate that investigation but the race angle? Cheap",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:25:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250041205966889e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525006507080179712",
      "text": "@SuzyBlueLady @ronfullwood @washingtonpost an opinion? Sure. but that could change based on evidence/facts. Sad to have to defend that",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:31:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2500533871906e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524995888390098944",
      "text": "@Terryesimms @washingtonpost #DarrenWilson hasn't has the balls to speak out about the shooting m",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:49:08 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.249894005483766e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "524998539710300160",
      "text": "@ronfullwood @SuzyBlueLady @washingtonpost Only people giving Mike Brown the benefit of the doubt are people with a certain agenda.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 18:59:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2499771206508134e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525001598142279680",
      "text": "@ronfullwood @SuzyBlueLady @washingtonpost &amp; that's my outrage. The focus should be on excessive force &amp; a better way where people don't die",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:11:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250004005971763e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525004636542226432",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers @SuzyBlueLady @washingtonpost I'd like to have seen more of this officer's history. We have one report of wanton violence",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:23:54 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2500425299830374e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525006792225718272",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers @SuzyBlueLady @washingtonpost I'm going to disconnect from the convo at this point. Thanks for the discussion NMM.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:32:28 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.250062593519903e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525004334929833985",
      "text": "@notmichaelmyers @SuzyBlueLady @washingtonpost So, we'll j accept anything damning to the victim, accept anything favorable to the shooter?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 19:22:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2500399870603264e+17,
